      "answer": "Southwest's 87 737 MAX 8 aircraft were compliant with FAA AD 2020-05-11 (pre-service compliance November 2020) and FAA AD 2022-03-07 (completed April 2022). For FAA AD 2024-01-02, compliance was still due as of the January 1, 2024 registry date, with a deadline of May 15, 2024; all 87 aircraft had MCAS v1.7.3 installed, and updates to MCAS v2.0 were scheduled February-May 2024 at roughly 10 aircraft per month.",
